uestion", "name": "Does Manh Long Optical sell Trivex lenses?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Not as a separate listed option on the current price list. If you need Trivex specifically, ask at the counter and we'll check what's available."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is glass better than plastic?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "It looks slightly clearer, but it's nearly twice as heavy and can shatter into sharp pieces on hard impact. For safety, almost no optical shop sells glass lenses anymore, including Manh Long Optical."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "My prescription has a prism value, what do I do?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Bring your prescription to the shop. Our technician will recommend the right lens and frame to fit the correct prism base direction and amount your doctor prescribed."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Does lens material affect my prescription strength?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Material and index only affect thickness, durability and clarity; your actual correction comes from an accurate eye test, not from the lens material."}}]}, {"@type": "BreadcrumbList", "@id": "https://manhlongoptical.com/en/learn/lens-materials-explained.html#breadcrumb", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://manhlongoptical.com/en/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Learn", "item": "https://manhlongoptical.com/en/learn/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Lens Materials Compared", "item": "https://manhlongoptical.com/en/learn/lens-materials-explained.html"}]}]}</script>
